---
---

<section class="says section">
  <div class="rule-head" data-reveal>
    <p class="rule-head__index">
      <span class="label label--lg">(05)</span>
      <span class="label label--lg">What people say</span>
    </p>
    <p class="rule-head__note">One person you can text.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="says__body">
    <div class="plate says__plate" data-reveal>
      <img
        class="plate__media"
        src="/img/testimonial.jpg"
        alt="Geet at the desk, mid-build"
        width="400"
        height="500"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>

    <figure class="says__quote" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:100ms">
      <blockquote class="says__text">
        “Geet was instrumental in bringing our website to life. On-time delivery
        meant minimal back-and-forth for us.”
      </blockquote>

      <figcaption class="says__foot">
        <div class="says__who">
          <span class="label says__name">Natasha Bandodkar</span>
          <span class="says__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="label says__role">
            Founder · Independent Creators Co
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="says__second">
          “Working with Geet has been truly smooth and reliable — incredibly
          proactive, communicative, and solution-driven.” — Chimene Adeptie,
          Founder, Creo Agency
        </p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .says {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding-bottom: var(--section-y);
  }

  .says__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 400fr) minmax(0, 800fr);
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 60px);
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: clamp(44px, 5.5vw, 80px);
  }

  .says__plate {
    aspect-ratio: 400 / 500;
  }

  .says__plate .plate__media {
    height: 100%;
  }

  .says__quote {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .says__text {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-quote);
    line-height: var(--leading-quote);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-h4);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .says__foot {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: clamp(24px, 2.5vw, 36px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .says__who {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .says__name {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .says__role {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .says__dot {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: rgb(26 46 242 / 40%);
  }

  .says__second {
    max-width: 87.5%;
    font-size: var(--text-caption);
    line-height: var(--leading-caption);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .says__body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
